@startuml
!include ../_template_styles.puml

autonumber
actor User
participant API
database Leader
database Replica

User -> API : Update profile photo to v2
API -> Leader : Write v2
Leader --> API : ACK
API --> User : 200 OK

... t + 1 second ...

User -> API : Read profile photo
API -> Replica : Read latest value
Replica --> API : returns v1 (replication lag)
API --> User : stale response

User -> API : Retry with strong consistency
API -> Leader : Read from leader
Leader --> API : returns v2
API --> User : fresh response

@enduml
